~ tutorial_start

Serika: Welcome to Serika Social! Let's get you oriented for touch controls.
Serika: **Drag the left side** of the screen to move — a virtual joystick appears where you touch.
Serika: **Drag the right side** to look around.
Serika: Tap the **Jump button** (bottom-right) to jump.
Serika: Tap the **View button** to toggle between first-person and third-person view.
Serika: Tap the **chat icon** at the top to open text chat.
Serika: Press **Esc** or the back button to open the pause menu.
Serika: Walk into the glowing portal to travel to The Commons — the multiplayer gathering space.
Serika: That's it! Enjoy your time in Serika Social. => END
